      "value": "Also, at the 3-4 second mark in the video below, when moving the Constrain from the arm to the face, a circle momentarily appears in an enlarged state on the arm side. This issue seems to occur only in the mirror.\n\nIt’s possible that the Constrain's behavior is acting strangely only in the mirror.\n\nhttps://x.com/Tukumomi_VR/status/1854752976415735868",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
