      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This issue was improved in Build 1535, but a different issue has arisen, so I posted it as a separate Canny.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/position-of-constraints-under-the-avatars-hips-becomes-incorrect-in-the-mirror-w",
